SUMMARY:The Transformative Power of Love: Empowerment of Buddha Maitreya
DESCRIPTION:Meditation in Asheville: Meditation and Modern Buddhism\nThe T
 ransformative Power of Love: Empowerment of Buddha Maitreya with Modern Bu
 ddhism Teacher Kadam Sharon Lovich\n\nLove is the key to a happy and meani
 ngful life. When we have a strong loving mind\, our whole experience of th
 e world changes - our life fills with hope\, our relationships become stro
 nger\, and we naturally contribute to a more positive world.\nBuddha Maitr
 eya is the embodiment of loving kindness of all the Buddhas. The empowerme
 nt is a blissful guided meditation that connects us to Maitreya’s enligh
 tened love awakening our own potential to develop the universal love of a 
 Buddha. By receiving his inspiring blessings we can swiftly actualize our 
 own potential for love and gain the confidence we need to progress along t
 he spiritual path.\n***“An empowerment bestows upon us special blessings
  that heal our mental continuum and awaken our Buddha nature.”***\n*— 
 Venerable Geshe Kelsang Gyatso Rinpoche*\nIn the commentary\, we will lear
 n the special brief practice of Buddha Maitreya. Through identifying stron
 gly with this Buddha’s qualities\, we nurture them within ourselves\; in
  this way we begin to become someone whose love transforms the world.\nAn 
 empowerment is a special ceremony in which we receive the blessings that h
 eal our mental continuum and awaken our Buddha nature. It consists of medi
 tations\, guided visualizations and prayers followed by a teachings to exp
 lain the practice. Everybody Welcome.\nCost $70\n[Read More and Register](
 https://www.meditationinasheville.org/buddha-maitreya-empowerment-the-tran
 sformative-power-of-love/)\n[Become a Member](https://www.meditationinashe
 ville.org/become-a-member/)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/meditationinasheville/events/31628294
 1/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260826T161017Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260826T161017Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
